        strategy: {
          basic: 'Remember the unusual card ranking (3-2-Ace are high). Try to capture 3s, 2s, and Aces. In bidding, only bid if you have strong cards.',
          intermediate: "When calling a partner, call a card you don't have but suspect an opponent might. Use the monte exchange to improve your hand composition. Try to deduce who your partner is from their plays.",
